{
  "slug": "pdf-viewer",
  "name": "PDF Viewer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "View, annotate, and sign PDFs in a live interactive viewer. Mark up contracts, fill forms with visual feedback, stamp approvals, and place signatures — then download the annotated copy.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `view-pdf` (Interactive PDF viewer)\n- **Commands** (4): `annotate` (Collaboratively annotate a PDF — propose markup, review together, iterate), `fill-form` (Fill PDF form fields interactively with live visual feedback), `open` (Open a PDF in the interactive viewer), `sign` (Place a signature or initials image on a PDF)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `pdf`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pdf-viewer@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`pdf-viewer`).",
